@startuml SSD_05_Create_Room
title SSD-05 방 생성하기
actor "플레이어" as Player
participant "Game System" as System

Player -> System: createRoom(roomName, maxPlayers, isPublic)
alt 생성 성공
  System --> Player: roomCreated(roomId)
  System --> Player: enterWaitingRoom(roomId)
else 생성 실패
  System --> Player: showCreateRoomError(reason)
end
@enduml

@startuml SSD_06_Join_Room
title SSD-06 방 참가하기
actor "플레이어" as Player
participant "Game System" as System

Player -> System: joinRoom(roomId)
System -> System: validateRoomJoin(roomId, playerId)
alt 참가 가능
  System --> Player: roomJoined(roomId)
  System --> Player: showWaitingRoom(roomInfo)
else 방 없음/인원 초과/중복 입장
  System --> Player: joinRoomRejected(reason)
end
@enduml

@startuml SSD_07_Chatting
title SSD-07 채팅하기
actor "플레이어" as Player
actor "같은 방 플레이어들" as Others
participant "Game System" as System

Player -> System: sendChatMessage(message)
System -> System: validateChatMessage(message)
alt 메시지 유효
  System --> Player: displayChatMessage(sender, message)
  System --> Others: displayChatMessage(sender, message)
else 빈 메시지 또는 방 미입장
  System --> Player: chatRejected(reason)
end
@enduml

@startuml SSD_08_Start_Stage
title SSD-08 스테이지 시작하기
actor "방장" as Host
actor "방 플레이어들" as Players
participant "Game System" as System

Players -> System: setReady(playerId, isReady)
Host -> System: requestStartStage()
System -> System: validateStartCondition(roomId)
alt 모든 플레이어 Ready
  System --> Players: stageStartAnnounced(startTime)
  System --> Players: loadStage(stageId)
else 시작 조건 미충족
  System --> Host: startStageRejected(reason)
end
@enduml
